Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.45,0:00:05.89,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Isn't this nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.11,0:00:09.61,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,We haven't been on a trip \Nsince we went camping.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.61,0:00:10.61,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:13.51,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,and it's our first time just \Nthe two of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.80,0:00:16.41,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to stumble \Ninto a hot springs town on our drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.41,0:00:19.94,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes, it was a good idea to stop by!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.09,0:00:24.05,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I don't do hot springs, \Nbut the footbath is nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.05,0:00:27.34,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What?! You can't do hot springs either?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.34,0:00:31.08,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well... I {\i1}can{\i0} do them...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.40,0:00:41.12,Flashback,Man,0,0,0,,And down I...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.84,0:00:42.99,Flashback,Tonome,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.17,0:00:48.78,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,At hot springs and public baths, \NI'm at risk of being sat on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.78,0:00:50.21,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's not fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.21,0:00:52.36,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Ah, I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.36,0:00:58.62,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I can use them if I have help, \Nbut I always hate to be a bother...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.62,0:01:00.99,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I end up thinking, "I can have \Na hot bath at home."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.16,0:01:04.11,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I guess hot springs are \Na bridge too far for both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.82,0:01:12.30,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,But this might also be my first time \Nfeeling properly healed by a hot spring...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.07,0:01:18.00,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes, agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.56,0:01:27.01,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Are you ready to head back?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.01,0:01:30.73,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I can't wait to eat these \Nhot spring eggs at home!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.05,0:01:37.40,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Sir, please, you can't—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.40,0:01:39.48,Main,Customer,0,0,0,,I've had enough! I'm leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.48,0:01:40.89,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,P-Please, let's talk this out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.89,0:01:43.23,Main,Customer,0,0,0,,I knew it wasn't just my imagination!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.23,0:01:46.73,Main,Customer,0,0,0,,I'm not staying in this haunted house!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.73,0:01:48.64,Main - Top,Proprietress,0,0,0,,It's not a haunted house!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.20,0:01:50.00,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What's that all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.64,0:01:50.00,Main - Top,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Please, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.19,0:01:52.67,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It appears the local inn is haunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.95,0:01:56.18,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,We've been called to investigate \Nhauntings from time to time...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.18,0:01:57.66,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Have they ever been real?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.34,0:02:03.20,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Paranormal activity tends to be \Nsomeone's fears getting out of control,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.20,0:02:06.35,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,or the abilities \Nof previously undiscovered races.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.00,0:02:11.61,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,You investigate hauntings?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:22.72,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Do forgive the sudden request.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.72,0:02:26.41,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,I am the proprietress of this inn,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.41,0:02:30.38,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,and we've been plagued \Nby rumors of a haunting of late!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.59,0:02:33.51,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I'm here \Nin a personal capacity...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.51,0:02:36.94,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,I'll put you up for free \Nwhile you investigate!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.94,0:02:39.00,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,All-inclusive!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.00,0:02:42.46,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,So please, stay and help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.08,0:02:42.46,Main - Top,Tonome,0,0,0,,Th-This was supposed to be \Na day trip, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.94,0:02:46.23,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You're free to visit my \Nagency at a later date.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.88,0:02:55.31,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,But in the meantime, I'll keep \Nbeing swamped by awful reviews!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.31,0:02:58.82,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,I can't afford to lose more customers!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.82,0:03:00.44,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,But I'm serious—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.44,0:03:05.65,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,I'll rent you my best room,\Nwith an open-air bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.53,0:03:08.92,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,It's built on \Nuniversal design principles,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.22,0:03:12.13,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,so I guarantee a comfortable stay...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.39,0:03:14.06,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}A private, open-air bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.99,0:03:19.62,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}No one else around!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.26,0:03:24.08,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's just not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.08,0:03:26.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I have another job to do tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.00,0:03:29.00,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I can go in by myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.93,0:03:34.20,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Um... I {\i1}could{\i0} rearrange our schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.44,0:03:36.96,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I think it would be possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.83,0:03:47.66,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,The attendant will show\Nyou to your room!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.37,0:03:52.27,Main,Attendant,0,0,0,,Right this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.75,0:03:57.76,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}The room's set up like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.72,0:04:02.25,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}It does have nice scenery...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.55,0:04:05.18,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}But the bath is visible \Nfrom inside the room...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.42,0:04:08.51,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}How am I going to tell Shizuka-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.96,0:04:14.38,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}If I just close the curtain \Nto block off the view,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.64,0:04:18.11,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}I probably won't need to tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.48,0:04:25.03,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}Maybe this is what she meant \Nabout me being too accommodating?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.03,0:04:28.53,Main,Attendant,0,0,0,,That should be everything. \NDo enjoy your stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.20,0:04:33.18,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san, I want to \Nget right into the bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:37.36,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'll speak to the proprietress \Nabout the haunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.36,0:04:39.38,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Call me if you need any help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.38,0:04:40.60,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.96,0:04:43.47,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,BATHS ARE ONLY AVAILABLE TO\NOVERNIGHT CLIENTS AT THIS TIME
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.14,0:04:47.17,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You really don't have\Nany customers, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.17,0:04:50.07,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Yes, it's as bad as it looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.07,0:04:52.26,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,We've had a string of cancellations...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.27,0:04:53.31,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,THEY REALLY NEED TO FIX THAT.\NIT WAS SCARY, CREEPY, AND I HATED IT!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.59,0:04:55.52,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I guess it is the reviews.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.31,0:04:55.52,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,BLOOD COVERING THE FLOOR?!\NTOO FREAKY FOR ME...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.84,0:04:57.88,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Blood covering the floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.87,0:05:01.32,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's certainly an unsettling image...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.32,0:05:02.95,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,It's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.95,0:05:05.39,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,I'd certainly have noticed \Nblood on the floors!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.39,0:05:09.07,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes, and they say it \Ndisappeared right after...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.07,0:05:11.32,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Had you heard about this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.45,0:05:17.39,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,A customer once called the front desk\Nabout it in the middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.22,0:05:22.24,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,We went to check later \Nand saw nothing of the sort!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.38,0:05:23.26,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,SAW A PALE FIGURE AT NIGHT. TOO CREEPY. \NLOVED THE FRESH FOOD, THOUGH.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.63,0:05:26.17,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,What about the dragging sounds at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.26,0:05:26.18,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,HEARD DRAGGING SOUNDS DURING THE NIGHT.\NWAY TOO CREEPY!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.17,0:05:31.18,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,You may hear customers' luggage \N during the day, but never at night!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.41,0:05:35.55,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}Dragging sounds... Is it related \Nto the bloodstained floors?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.19,0:05:39.48,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,What about this "torso ghost"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.94,0:05:39.48,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,SAW A GHOSTLY TORSO FLOATING BY DURING\NTHE NIGHT. I THINK THE PLACE IS HAUNTED.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.69,0:05:41.84,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It seems to appear at night, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:43.48,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,There's no ghost here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.48,0:05:48.49,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,I've worked at this inn for ages, \Nand never seen the likes of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.70,0:05:52.72,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, it's true that not a single \Nhaunting I've investigated
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.72,0:05:55.58,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,had a real ghost behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.77,0:05:59.62,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,As you can see, \NI'm completely at my wit's end!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.62,0:06:02.52,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,We had no idea about \Nany of this until people
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.52,0:06:05.84,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,started complaining \Nand leaving those reviews!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.16,0:06:07.19,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.21,0:06:10.36,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'll continue my investigation, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.81,0:06:19.81,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}No traces of blood \Nin the hallway that I can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.27,0:06:24.17,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}Was it wiped up immediately after? \NTo hide the evidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.00,0:06:31.32,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}The only witnesses are guests, \Nand it mostly happens late at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.65,0:06:36.16,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}The reviews talk about impressions,\N nothing particularly concrete.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.58,0:06:39.33,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}Not nearly enough information \Nor evidence to go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.66,0:06:43.19,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}I'd have preferred to approach this \Nwith more time and equipment...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.22,0:06:47.72,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}I can't believe I was bought off \Nwith an open-air bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.04,0:06:51.40,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}If I can't solve it today, \NI'll have to come back another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.17,0:06:54.52,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.72,0:06:57.98,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.98,0:07:01.28,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,The attendant helped me into a yukata!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.33,0:07:07.47,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}Drat. My gratitude is starting \Nto overtake my regrets!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.68,0:07:09.76,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You look beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.76,0:07:11.04,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.66,0:07:13.93,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,The bath was just heavenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.93,0:07:15.80,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You should try it, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.80,0:07:18.67,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,No, I should get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.51,0:07:22.44,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes, I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.44,0:07:24.55,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for getting ahead of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.69,0:07:36.46,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,This time, you're not going to \Nlet work take over your personal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.46,0:07:38.18,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.80,0:07:46.26,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,The reviews suggest the phenomena \Nhappens mostly at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.26,0:07:48.49,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It should be fine to wait until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.96,0:07:54.44,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Isn't this a window?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.44,0:07:57.20,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Why did Akira-san close the curtains?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.36,0:08:00.73,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,He's free to enjoy \Nthe scenery if he wants...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.73,0:08:03.02,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Is he accommodating me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.02,0:08:03.77,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Darn it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.11,0:08:08.25,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san. I'm sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.44,0:08:11.84,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san, why did you \Nclose the curtains?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.84,0:08:12.52,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.75,0:08:17.32,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Didn't the attendant say the view \Nfrom the room was incredible?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.32,0:08:18.11,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.11,0:08:20.92,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Stop worrying about me and just enjoy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.92,0:08:23.14,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You don't need to be \Naccommodating like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.76,0:08:26.15,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I've brought this on myself, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.57,0:08:27.14,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.77,0:08:34.16,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I didn't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.16,0:08:37.12,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I-It's fine, since I can't see...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.12,0:08:39.35,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, I also can't be seen...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.35,0:08:40.87,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.11,0:08:43.67,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Even if you can't be seen,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.67,0:08:47.30,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,you don't like having people look \Ninto your clothing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.30,0:08:52.04,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I was covered in lather, so that \Ndoes lead to some embarrassment...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.40,0:08:54.25,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.55,0:08:56.09,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, I'm invisible,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.09,0:08:58.86,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,so it's not really \Na rational embarrassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.86,0:09:02.27,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,But now I'm catching your embarrassment!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.51,0:09:04.55,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.55,0:09:06.51,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Do not apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.63,0:09:14.86,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,L-Let's have a meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.86,0:09:16.93,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,The hauntings don't start \Nuntil nightfall,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.93,0:09:18.40,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,so let's take our time and enjoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.40,0:09:19.60,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,O-Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.23,0:09:25.20,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What was that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.46,0:09:34.05,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Was that a paranormal phenomenon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.05,0:09:36.23,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's surely too soon...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.56,0:09:39.22,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm checking it out! \NWait here, Shizuka-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:41.72,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.72,0:09:43.56,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.90,0:09:45.70,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,By myself, I'll be...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.08,0:09:50.12,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,too scared... please...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.06,0:09:52.98,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.54,0:09:58.18,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'll protect you, Shizuka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.74,0:10:01.27,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm not scared as long as there's light.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.48,0:10:04.56,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I suppose that's not very reassuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.56,0:10:06.41,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,That's not true at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.41,0:10:09.11,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,If you don't mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.86,0:10:12.54,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Could I come with you \Non your investigation?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.05,0:10:15.75,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Of course! I'd be happy to have you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.20,0:10:22.80,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,All right. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.80,0:10:23.34,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.18,0:10:30.15,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, that was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.15,0:10:31.06,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Fast?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.26,0:10:33.58,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,There's a mysterious fluid on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.03,0:10:35.16,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Is it blood?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.65,0:10:39.00,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'll walk us to where \NI can see it clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.36,0:10:49.53,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's black.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.53,0:10:51.08,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Black blood?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.87,0:10:56.77,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's rather viscous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.77,0:10:58.59,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Viscous blood?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.24,0:11:02.97,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Wait, that smells like...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.40,0:11:11.77,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.77,0:11:14.84,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I saw a person, cut in half, \Nfloating along.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.84,0:11:17.60,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,C-Cut in half?! Floating?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.60,0:11:21.25,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Sorry, maybe that \Nwas too frank a description.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.25,0:11:23.82,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,No, don't apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.01,0:11:26.24,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm not a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.24,0:11:31.20,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You don't need to mince words \Nwhen giving me information.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.47,0:11:32.75,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.40,0:11:44.21,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,The sound... It's coming closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.70,0:11:52.15,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I see. The mystery is solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.76,0:11:57.40,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,You've really found the truth?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.70,0:11:58.35,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.64,0:12:02.52,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,The ocean view from our room \Nis what made it all clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.52,0:12:04.03,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.34,0:12:06.44,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'll get right to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.68,0:12:10.18,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,The truth behind the paranormal \Nphenomena and the haunting...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.62,0:12:11.51,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.01,0:12:14.44,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,These people!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.29,0:12:18.48,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,My employees?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.48,0:12:21.18,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,A-Are you playing a prank on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.05,0:12:24.51,Main,Attendant,0,0,0,,C-Certainly not!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.77,0:12:28.31,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,No, they're just going \Nabout their jobs normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.47,0:12:33.28,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,But it's so normal to you all, \Nyou don't perceive it as paranormal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.28,0:12:34.37,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,"Normal"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.85,0:12:38.89,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Ma'am, you mentioned the attendant \Nwas leaving early today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.89,0:12:41.43,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.43,0:12:44.87,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,She's had to pull so many \Nlate nights recently...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.07,0:12:48.88,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You were on your way \Nhome earlier, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.88,0:12:50.08,Main,Attendant,0,0,0,,Y-Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.08,0:12:53.82,Main,Attendant,0,0,0,,But I left something behind, \Nso I came back to get it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.93,0:12:59.07,Flashback - Italics,Attendant,0,0,0,,{M}I'll get home early today!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.58,0:13:00.38,Flashback - Italics,Attendant,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.04,0:13:03.60,Flashback - Italics,Attendant,0,0,0,,{M}I forgot my kimono cord!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.30,0:13:10.24,Flashback - Italics,Attendant,0,0,0,,{M}So much for getting home early!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.03,0:13:10.24,Flashback - Top - Italics,Squid,0,0,0,,{\i0}Achoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.50,0:13:17.11,Flashback,Attendant,0,0,0,,Thank goodness I found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.11,0:13:26.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It was the sound of your \Nemployee moving around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.64,0:13:30.59,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Impossible! All this fuss \Nover a few ordinary noises?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.85,0:13:33.04,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,The incidents happened mostly at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.34,0:13:36.41,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,And you mentioned she'd \Nbeen pulling late nights...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.41,0:13:42.43,Main,Attendant,0,0,0,,Yes, when it's late, I'm often in a hurry \Nto get the last of my work done...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.74,0:13:46.43,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,As for the "bloody" floors,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.43,0:13:49.22,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,when I talked to the \Nattendant in the hallway...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.45,0:13:51.72,Flashback,Tonome,0,0,0,,The reviews have been \Ncomplaining about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.72,0:13:53.52,Flashback,Attendant,0,0,0,,I'm not sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.45,0:14:03.36,Flashback,Tonome,0,0,0,,What's this all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.53,0:14:04.73,Flashback,Squid,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.87,0:14:12.72,Flashback,Squid,0,0,0,,Oh, there I go again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.72,0:14:15.56,Flashback,Squid,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I've had a bit of a cold...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.95,0:14:18.91,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's his ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.91,0:14:22.80,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'd thought it smelled familiar!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.80,0:14:25.51,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Don't you have a handkerchief?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.51,0:14:27.70,Main,Squid,0,0,0,,Of course I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.70,0:14:29.79,Main,Squid,0,0,0,,But sometimes I don't get to it in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.79,0:14:33.00,Main,Squid,0,0,0,,or the ones I have get \Nall soaked through...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.63,0:14:42.53,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,And the thing they have in common\Nis what helped me crack the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.24,0:14:47.48,Flashback,Tonome,0,0,0,,The torso was a rather pallid color.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.74,0:14:50.23,Flashback,Attendant,0,0,0,,Well, it could be...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.23,0:14:51.74,Flashback,Attendant,0,0,0,,You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.14,0:14:56.55,Flashback,Attendant,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.11,0:14:58.32,Flashback,Tonome,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.14,0:15:04.17,Flashback,Merfolk,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.28,0:15:09.34,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,This merfolk with a black tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.70,0:15:13.23,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,S-Something so simple \Ncaused all this fuss?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.23,0:15:15.58,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,What they have in common \Nis being on the night shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.58,0:15:19.02,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,When customers run into them at night \Nwhen there's no one around,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.02,0:15:22.96,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,they likely get scared \Nand lock themselves in their rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.18,0:15:27.46,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,By the time they come out, \Nthe ink has already been cleaned up,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.46,0:15:29.52,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,and there's no one to be seen or heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.52,0:15:36.54,Main,Attendant,0,0,0,,S-So we were scaring the customers \Njust by going about our business?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.74,0:15:41.32,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Your inn is by the sea, \Nso a lot of aquatic races work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.52,0:15:43.33,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,These things are normal for all of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.33,0:15:46.86,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,but tourists haven't seen \Nanything like it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.86,0:15:49.58,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,So they assumed it was paranormal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.58,0:15:53.18,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,And that explains why we didn't notice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.18,0:15:56.52,Main,Attendant,0,0,0,,I never thought that \Nthe sounds that were normal
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.52,0:15:59.36,Main,Attendant,0,0,0,,to us would seem eerie to other races...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.36,0:16:03.02,Main,Merfolk,0,0,0,,I've slipped on the squid ink \Nbefore myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.89,0:16:06.28,Main,Squid,0,0,0,,But I always wipe it up right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.09,0:16:09.73,Main,Squid,0,0,0,,Achoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.99,0:16:11.88,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,I'm soaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.28,0:16:14.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, now that we know the cause,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.64,0:16:18.71,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,we can discuss tomorrow how to deal \Nwith it all, including reviews.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.87,0:16:21.68,Main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Of course! Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.40,0:16:26.84,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It feels great to solve the mystery!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.84,0:16:29.84,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm sorry we had to put off our meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.20,0:16:33.37,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,But the food here is so delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.37,0:16:34.20,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.74,0:16:39.23,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,The baths here are amazing, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.23,0:16:41.36,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I hope things turn around for them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.36,0:16:42.82,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.03,0:16:47.44,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,And now that the case is behind us, \Nwe can have a good night's sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.03,0:16:50.37,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You're going right to sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.58,0:16:55.76,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You were incredible today, Akira-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.28,0:17:00.40,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I want you to kiss me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.55,0:17:06.09,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,We have an early day tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.78,0:17:07.85,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Let's get to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.80,0:17:09.58,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.48,0:17:11.36,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.51,0:17:14.91,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Good night...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.22,0:17:24.31,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.63,0:17:27.05,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It's possible this is \Njust my imagination, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.05,0:17:30.98,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Sometimes, it feels like \Nsomething's holding you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.92,0:17:36.07,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,W-Well, but it has been a long day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.07,0:17:38.36,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I know you're tired. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.72,0:17:47.58,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Maybe Akira-san's just not \Nbig on physical affection.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.00,0:17:49.79,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}There are people like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.91,0:17:56.61,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Wait, maybe I'm just \Nnot visually attractive?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.05,0:18:00.88,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I don't know what that's like \Nfor people who can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.88,0:18:03.24,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,but I've heard that it's a factor...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.23,0:18:08.15,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I get it. I'm ugly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.45,0:18:11.95,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I've never really thought \Nabout my face before...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.95,0:18:14.48,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}What a shocking truth \Nto have to face now...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.82,0:18:17.26,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I'm ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.61,0:18:18.90,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Where did that come from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.90,0:18:22.06,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You won't canoodle with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.06,0:18:24.12,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Seriously, where \Nare you getting this from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.12,0:18:28.25,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I get it. It's hard to admit to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.25,0:18:33.56,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,All right. Let's talk this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.28,0:18:35.20,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.20,0:18:37.94,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'll have to talk \Nabout my last girlfriend,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.94,0:18:40.72,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,so it might make you uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:42.52,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Do you still want to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.47,0:18:44.30,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.37,0:18:49.43,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,At my last job... when I was \Nworking at a big detective agency,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.04,0:18:52.04,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I was in an interspecies romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.69,0:18:56.79,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,She tried hard to understand me \Nas an invisible person,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.79,0:19:00.28,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,and I tried hard to understand her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.67,0:19:06.05,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I felt like there was a time when we \Nboth really trusted each other, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.12,0:19:18.77,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,But, one night, it was like \Nshe couldn't bear it anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.93,0:19:26.56,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Or rather, I suppose it took \Na lot of courage to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.91,0:19:28.51,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,that I frightened her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.07,0:19:34.01,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,She couldn't help but feel afraid of \Nbeing touched by someone she couldn't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.07,0:19:39.15,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Just being who I am triggered \Nan instinctive fear in my partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.43,0:19:42.49,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,She always looked so happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.28,0:19:47.11,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,But I think she was just \Ntrying not to hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.88,0:19:49.99,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I felt like I'd done \Nsomething awful to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.31,0:20:03.81,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Er... What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.00,0:20:11.00,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Where's that mouth of yours now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.97,0:20:13.23,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.96,0:20:16.43,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.28,0:20:22.82,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,That's my right cheek.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.00,0:20:24.08,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.21,0:20:27.60,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,That's my nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.60,0:20:28.57,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.31,0:20:33.63,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,My upper lip.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.12,0:20:37.23,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Is that full credit? Half credit?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.63,0:20:39.10,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Let's say full credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.61,0:20:47.42,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,My eyelid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.83,0:20:53.52,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It was a little wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.52,0:20:54.89,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,How insensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.60,0:21:07.20,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Would you like to spend \Nthe night like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.66,0:21:11.24,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.57,0:21:14.55,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,If you'll get off me for a minute, \NI'll pull the cover over us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.55,0:21:18.58,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Aw, I thought we could \Nstay like this awhile!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.58,0:21:20.02,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You'll catch a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.74,0:21:22.88,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Get your yukata back on straight, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.16,0:21:27.16,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I don't know how to fix it. \NYou'll have to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.16,0:21:28.10,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.19,0:21:34.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You're enjoying yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.52,0:21:38.57,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I can smell you.
